<title>USA: Realco authorized stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Realco authorized stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Realco Inc said its board has adopted a stock purchase plan under which it may buy up to 150,000 shares of Realco stock on the open market.</p>
<p>Purchases may be made from time to time, subject to market conditions and other factors, it said.</p>
</text>
